@@ -0,0 +1,130 @@
+# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
+# OLDGRIDS: Helpful Open-source Research TOol for N-fermion systems.
+# Copyright (C) 2011-2017 The OLDGRIDS Development Team
+#
+# This file is part of OLDGRIDS.
+#
